[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2671267032","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100881#issuecomment-2671267032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100881","id":2671267032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fOEzY","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-20T11:48:59Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T11:48:59Z","body":"Sorry I didn't see this issue at the time.\n\nThis is related to the assumption in 3D and 2D that the bones in skeletons will be moved on the frame rather than using physics interpolation. This _usually_ works fine (for regular animation) but breaks down in some cases, ragdoll IK and driving animation on physics ticks.\n\nThere's a lot of related issues when using outside of this assumption and it's possible they can mostly be fixed by some simple changes, like defaulting `Skeletons` to OFF for physics interpolation, but using interpolated bones in the renderer if the user switches them manually to ON.\n\nI'll take a look into this.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2671267032/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2671928143","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100881#issuecomment-2671928143","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100881","id":2671928143,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fQmNP","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-20T15:58:07Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T15:58:07Z","body":"OK it looks like the whole bone system for 2D (and maybe 3D too) is setup only for frame based operation (it works outside normal canvas items), so in order to get interpolation to work per bone we can't rely on the existing mechanisms and would need to explicitly add support either scene side or `VisualServer` side.\n\nKnowing how much of a nightmare it was to get skinning working correctly server side, I'm suspecting that doing this scene side might be easier, even if slightly less efficient in some scenarios.\n\nThis so far is only a problem for:\n* Moving bones manually in physics tick\n* Ragdoll (which moves bones in physics tick)\n\nEverything else, including animation and IK can move bones on frames.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2671928143/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767553324","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100881#issuecomment-2767553324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100881","id":2767553324,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k9YMs","user":{"login":"mathead","id":3639083,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzkwODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3639083?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead","html_url":"https://github.com/mathead","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T22:24:33Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T22:24:33Z","body":"In my case, I was using PhysicsBodies to move the bones of the Skeleton2D. To work around the issue, I wrote a script to manually interpolate and update the bone position:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\n@export var remote_path: String\n\n@onready var prev = get_parent().global_position\n@onready var cur = get_parent().global_position\n@onready var node = get_node(remote_path)\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tphysics_interpolation_mode = Node.PHYSICS_INTERPOLATION_MODE_OFF\n\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tvar f = clamp(Engine.get_physics_interpolation_fraction(), 0, 1)\n\tnode.global_position = lerp(prev, cur, f)\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tprev = cur\n\tcur = get_parent().global_position\n```\n\nIt is quite slow though and doesn't scale up to a large number of bodies.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767553324/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769314937","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100881#issuecomment-2769314937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100881","id":2769314937,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lEGR5","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T13:11:41Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T13:11:41Z","body":"Sorry not been able to look at this yet, I've been rewriting the 3D physics interpolation so this will have to stay on the todo list for a bit.\n\nIt seems you have the gist of it, it is probably possible to do in gdscript, as you say a little slow compared to core.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769314937/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4826392999","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100881#issuecomment-4826392999","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100881","id":4826392999,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH6zppw","user":{"login":"mathead","id":3639083,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzkwODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3639083?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead","html_url":"https://github.com/mathead","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathead/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"ht